// WSword.exe's icon (Makefile: windres -I docs/icon): the sword, as the Android app's. ID 1: Explorer and the taskbar
// use the first icon resource.
1 ICON "wsword.ico"
// The application manifest (RT_MANIFEST 24, ID 1): UTF-8 as the process code page - a game files folder, or WSword's
// own folder, named with non-ASCII characters wasn't found (fopen and friends read paths in the system code page)
1 24 "windows.manifest"
